{"t": 1791968373.52, "event": "command", "who": "sam", "args": ["share", "62787", "--kind", "events", "--name", "events"], "exit": 0, "said": "Lent events (port 62787) to everyone in your groups, as many at once as want it. To let fewer in at once, change it on your home page, or `svrngs share 62787 --limit <number>`.\nsvrngs is running here already, so they can open it now.\n`svrngs unshare events` stops lending it.\nIf events takes a password on each request, paste what it takes in its Authorization header, then press Enter (Enter alone for none):", "ms": 9}
